Package: mc-rcon
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: any
Maintainer: Dylan Bulmer <dylan@bulmer.dev>
Depends: mc-server, ${shlibs:Depends}
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apt.bulmer.dev
Description: RCON console plugin for mc-server
 Adds the 'mc rcon' subcommand — an interactive console, or a single command
 against a running server — and the lifecycle hooks that make a shutdown
 graceful and a backup consistent: it warns players and counts them down before
 a stop, and flushes the world around a backup.
 .
 Also ships /usr/bin/rcon, a standalone client that reads its password from a
 file so the secret never appears in argv.
 .
 The plugin declares mc's ABI version in its manifest, so an incompatible pair
 of packages is refused by name rather than failing at run time.
